    "Name": "Sunder SD1-OR",
    "Details": "A Draconis Combine developed Omni mech, the Sunder is based on reverse engineered Loki and Thor Omnimechs. A 360-rated XL Engine allows the omnimech to carry 15 DHS along with 16.5 tons of armor and 36 tons of weapons. The Sunder SD1-OR is armed with a Clan LB-10X and a pair of Clan Large Pulse Lasers. 4 Clan ER Medium Lasers and paired Clan Streak-6’s act as secondary weapons. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Extended Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_sunder"
  },
